tps://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532440/5324400316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532440/5324400315.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532440/5324400314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532440/5324400313.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://archives.nseindia.com/annual_reports/AR_MPSLTD_2011_2012_31122012122020.zip","source":"the data provider"}],"analysis":{"summary":"MPS Limited reported its strongest first quarter in history for Q1 FY27, with reported revenue of INR 224.24 crores, EBITDA of INR 76.96 crores, and PAT of INR 50.39 crores. Management reaffirmed its outlook to comfortably cross INR 300 crores in EBITDA for FY27, viewing it as a floor rather than a ceiling. The company is experiencing margin expansion driven by operating leverage, a shift from effort-based pricing to outcome-based revenue, and the successful integration of recent acquisitions such as Unbound Medicine. Across Research Solutions, Education, and Corporate Learning segments, AI technologies are actively deployed to enhance verification, productivity, and customer outcomes. MPS Limited reported its strongest opening quarter in history for Q1 FY27, achieving record revenue of INR 22,424 Lakhs and an EBITDA margin of 34.32%.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company continues to expect to comfortably cross INR 300 crores in EBITDA in FY27.","quote":"We continue to expect the Company to comfortably cross INR 300 crores in EBITDA in FY'27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=24e4d51b-25c9-46ec-87e3-ec0ebb26767e.pdf"},{"claim":"Management reiterated its FY27 EBITDA guidance to comfortably cross INR 300 Crores.","quote":"FY27: TRACKING TO COMFORTBALY CROSS INR 300 CRORES IN EBITDA","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=0f2c9a6d-7a46-44ae-a149-b68925f2e76b.pdf"},{"claim":"The company expects to exceed INR 300 crores in EBITDA in FY27.","quote":"Looking ahead - based on our current run rate and operating plan, the Company is expected to comfortably cross INR 300 crores in EBITDA in FY’27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=19ba1493-4998-44d2-a6a5-2cd9b7f7615f.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Demand for AJE's newly launched Pre-Submission Peer Review has run well ahead of plan.","quote":"We launched Pre-Submission Peer Review in April, our first genuinely new service in more than two years, and demand has run well ahead of what we planned.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=24e4d51b-25c9-46ec-87e3-ec0ebb26767e.pdf"},{"claim":"Management expects demand for trusted AI deployment to expand in high-stakes knowledge workflows.","quote":"On the other side, the demand for what we call trusted AI deployment inside high-stakes knowledge workflows, so think of medicine, nursing, scholarly publishing, regulated learning accessibility, there the demand is going to expand sharply.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=19ba1493-4998-44d2-a6a5-2cd9b7f7615f.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The company acquired Unbound Medicine in February 2026.","quote":"Third, the Unbound Medicine acquisition, which closed on February 9, 2026.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=19ba1493-4998-44d2-a6a5-2cd9b7f7615f.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Reported revenue for the quarter was INR 224.24 crores, up 20.4 percent over the same quarter last year.","quote":"Reported revenue for the quarter was INR 224.24 crores, up 20.4 percent over the same quarter last year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=24e4d51b-25c9-46ec-87e3-ec0ebb26767e.pdf"},{"claim":"EBITDA was INR 76.96 crores, up 53.0 percent, with the EBITDA margin expanding to 34.3 percent from 27.0 percent a year ago.","quote":"EBITDA was INR 76.96 crores, up 53.0 percent, with the EBITDA margin expanding to 34.3 percent from 27.0 percent a year ago.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=24e4d51b-25c9-46ec-87e3-ec0ebb26767e.pdf"},{"claim":"Profit after tax grew 43.0 percent to INR 50.39 crores, and basic EPS came in at INR 29.70.","quote":"Profit after tax grew 43.0 percent to INR 50.39 crores, and basic EPS came in at INR 29.70, an all-time Q1 high, up from INR 20.78.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=24e4d51b-25c9-46ec-87e3-ec0ebb26767e.pdf"},{"claim":"Excluding AJE, underlying revenue grew 28.4 percent to INR 198.47 crores and EBITDA grew 50.5 percent.","quote":"Strip out AJE, which is resetting by design and which Christine will speak to, and the underlying business grew faster still: revenue up 28.4 percent to INR 198.47 crores, EBITDA up 50.5 percent, and the margin expanding close to five points to 32.4 percent.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=24e4d51b-25c9-46ec-87e3-ec0ebb26767e.pdf"},{"claim":"Research Solutions segment revenue was INR 123.23 crores, up 13.2 percent year over year, with EBITDA growing 37.9 percent.","quote":"Segment revenue was INR 123.23 crores, up 13.2 percent year over year, and it remained the largest part of MPS at 55 percent of total revenue. What I would draw your attention to is the quality of that growth. EBITDA grew 37.9 percent, well ahead of revenue, and the segment margin widened to 45.1 percent.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=24e4d51b-25c9-46ec-87e3-ec0ebb26767e.pdf"},{"claim":"Education segment revenue grew 42.2 percent year over year to INR 73.41 crores at a 35.1 percent EBITDA margin.","quote":"Segment revenue grew 42.2 percent year over year to INR 73.41 crores, and 22.1 percent over the prior quarter, at a 35.1 percent EBITDA margin.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=24e4d51b-25c9-46ec-87e3-ec0ebb26767e.pdf"},{"claim":"The company achieved an EBITDA margin of 30.7% for FY26.","quote":"EBITDA was INR 236 crores, up by 11.8%, with the EBITDA margin expanding to 30.7%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=19ba1493-4998-44d2-a6a5-2cd9b7f7615f.pdf"},{"claim":"Corporate learning headcount was reduced by approximately 32% year-on-year.","quote":"Headcount in the segment is down approximately 32% year-on-year on a much sharper cost base.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=19ba1493-4998-44d2-a6a5-2cd9b7f7615f.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"Total client count across the company rose from 404 to 841 a year ago.","quote":"you can see it most clearly in our client count, which rose across the Company to 841 from 404 a year ago as Unbound's institutional subscribers came onto our books.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=24e4d51b-25c9-46ec-87e3-ec0ebb26767e.pdf"},{"claim":"Client diversification stepped up structurally with 841 clients billed in Q1 FY27 compared to 404 a year ago.","quote":"Client diversification stepped up structurally: 841 clients billed in Q1 FY27 vs 404 a year ago, driven by Unbound Medicine's institutional subscriber base being added to our portfolio","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=0f2c9a6d-7a46-44ae-a149-b68925f2e76b.pdf"},{"claim":"The corporate learning segment closed Q4 with its strongest order book of FY26.","quote":"Q4 closed with the strongest order book of FY'26.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=19ba1493-4998-44d2-a6a5-2cd9b7f7615f.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"Total cash and cash equivalents stood at INR 138.02 crores as of 30 June, against borrowings of INR 37.63 crores.","quote":"Total cash and cash equivalents stood at INR 138.02 crores as of 30 June, against borrowings of INR 37.63 crores relating to the facility we drew for the Unbound Medicine acquisition.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=24e4d51b-25c9-46ec-87e3-ec0ebb26767e.pdf"},{"claim":"Debtors DSO improved QoQ to 45 days from 51 days.","quote":"DSO improved QoQ to 45 days from 51 days, reflecting enhanced collection efficiency and tighter working capital management","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=0f2c9a6d-7a46-44ae-a149-b68925f2e76b.pdf"},{"claim":"The Board decided not to recommend a final dividend for FY26 due to capital deployment in the Unbound Medicine acquisition and an active M&A pipeline.","quote":"Over FY’26, the Board has chosen not to recommend a final dividend. The reason is straightforward. We've deployed capital into the Unbound Medicine acquisition in February, we're carrying a hyperactive M&A pipeline, and the deployment opportunity in front of us exceeds the cash in hand.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=19ba1493-4998-44d2-a6a5-2cd9b7f7615f.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Management identified broader geopolitical and macroeconomic risks as potential external threats.","quote":"We exist in a shifting geopolitical environment. You and I wake up to the same unique news every day. There are broader geopolitical and macroeconomic risks, such as those we saw during the pandemic.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=19ba1493-4998-44d2-a6a5-2cd9b7f7615f.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The company expects to comfortably cross INR 300 crores in EBITDA in FY27.","quote":"We continue to expect the Company to comfortably cross INR 300 crores in EBITDA in FY'27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=24e4d51b-25c9-46ec-87e3-ec0ebb26767e.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"For FY28, targets are approximately INR 1,500 crores in revenue and around INR 450 crores in EBITDA.","quote":"So, to summarize: for FY’28, the targets are approximately INR 1,500 crores in revenue and around INR 450 crores in EBITDA.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=24e4d51b-25c9-46ec-87e3-ec0ebb26767e.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"Management targets tracking to comfortably cross INR 300 Crores in EBITDA for FY27.","quote":"FY27: TRACKING TO COMFORTBALY CROSS INR 300 CRORES IN EBITDA","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=0f2c9a6d-7a46-44ae-a149-b68925f2e76b.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"The company aims to cross INR 300 crores in EBITDA.","quote":"Looking ahead - based on our current run rate and operating plan, the Company is expected to comfortably cross INR 300 crores in EBITDA in FY’27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=19ba1493-4998-44d2-a6a5-2cd9b7f7615f.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":25,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":5,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}